      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "St. John's Wort is an herbal remedy that some people use for mild mood issues, but you must be extremely cautious when taking it alongside birth control. This herb is known to interfere with how other medications, including hormonal birth control, are metabolized by your body. Combining them can make your birth control ineffective, leading to unintended pregnancy. You should absolutely consult with your healthcare provider before trying this, as they can advise on safer alternatives.",
