      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i'll look into the vitamin d. but what about the st johns wort though? if i just take a small amount, like a low dose, i assume it wouldn't affect the pill that much right? i just really want to try it specifically because i heard it's really good for seasonal stuff.",
